# Connect Analysis — generated weekly exports from Connect Success Model v1.R.
# Firebase Realtime Database (ConnectAnalysis/*, ConnectAnalysisDeidentified/*,
# ConnectOptimization/*) is the verified live source — see upload_to_firebase.R
# and connect_analysis_ingestion_spec.md §2. These files individually run
# 50-100+ MB and keep growing, well past GitHub's 100MB-per-file hard limit, so
# they're no longer tracked in git. regenerate_manifest.js still writes/updates
# them locally (capped at the 2 newest runs) purely as an optional local-dev /
# same-origin fallback copy — analysis_results.html and demos/analysis_results.html
# both already fall back to Firebase automatically when these aren't present.
connect/connect_analysis/Connect_Analysis_*.json
connect/connect_analysis/latest.json
connect/connect_analysis/latest_deidentified.json
connect/connect_analysis/runs/*.json
